Value VENDOR (.+?)
Value SOFTWARE_VERSION (.+?)
Value BOOT_IMAGE (.+?)
Value SYSTEM_IMAGE (.+?)
Value SLOT (.+?)
Value UPTIME (.+?)
Value BOARD_TYPE (.+?)
Value DRAM (.+?)
Value FLASH (.+?)
Value REBOOT_REASON (.+?)
Value HOSTNAME (.+?)
Value SERIAL (.+?)
Value BIOS (.+?)
Value ROMMON (.+?)
Value SOFTWARE_IMAGE (.+?)
Value CONFIG_REGISTER (.+?)
Value MAC_ADDRESS (.+?)
Value RESTARTED (.+?)

Start
  ^${VENDOR} Nexus Operating System
  ^\s+BIOS:\s+version\s+${BIOS}\s*$$
  ^\s+(?:NXOS|system):\s+version\s+${SOFTWARE_VERSION}\s*$$
  ^\s+(?:NXOS|system) image file is:\s+${SYSTEM_IMAGE}\s*$$
  ^\s+kickstart image file is:\s+${BOOT_IMAGE}\s*$$
  ^\s+cisco\s+(?:Nexus9000\s+)?${BOARD_TYPE}\s+[cC]hassis\s*$$
  ^\s+.*with\s+${DRAM}\s+of memory\.
  ^\s+Processor Board ID\s+${SERIAL}\s*$$
  ^\s+Device name:\s+${HOSTNAME}\s*$$
  ^\s+bootflash:\s+${FLASH}\s*$$
  ^Kernel uptime is\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$
  ^\s+Reason:\s+${REBOOT_REASON}\s*$$
